{"id":201,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It is hard to believe these strangely shaped Pokémon are truly living creatures. I've pointed out that the species' many forms resemble writing from other lands; no one will take me seriously."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"This Pokémon is shaped like ancient writing. It is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown. Research into this topic is ongoing but nothing is known."},{"games":["Y","Diamond"],"text":"Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or Unown came first."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Their shapes look like hieroglyphs on ancient tablets. It is said that the two are somehow related."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"They seem to communicate among each other telepathically. They are always found stuck on walls."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"This POKéMON is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Because different types of UNOWN exist, it is said that they must have a variety of abilities."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rare","color":"Black","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":201,"name":"Unown","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,237]],"machine":[237],"egg":[],"tutor"